During the rebuttal phase, the authors addressed the following concerns:
- The motivation of the work, particularly inconsistencies between the identified problems and the proposed solutions;
- The rigor of certain conceptual definitions;
- The novelty of the proposed methods;
- The depth of the theoretical exploration.
